---
permalink: /members/
layout: base.njk
title: "Members | POAP KINGS | A Clash Royale Clan with Proof"
description: "Members hub — get into Discord, connect with leadership for Pass Royale rewards, get Elixir clan updates, and grab plug-and-play recruiting copy."
navActive: members
supercellDisclaimer: true
extraScripts: '<script src="/members-promo.js" defer></script>'
---
{% from "components.njk" import sectionHeading, infoCard, promoField, numberedCard %}
{%- set memberCount = clan.memberCount -%}
{%- set totalWins = rosterExplorer.members | sumBy('wins') -%}
{%- set winsK = (totalWins / 1000) | round -%}
{%- set latest = clanTrends.series | last -%}
{%- set minTrophies = clan.minTrophies | formatNumber -%}
{#- Elder band: a share of the CURRENT roster, so these numbers follow the clan
    rather than going stale. The percentages and thresholds are clan policy and
    live in elixir-bot/engine/management.py — if they change there, change them
    here. -#}
{%- set elderFloor = (memberCount * 0.20) | round -%}
{%- set elderCeil = (memberCount * 0.30) | round -%}
{%- set elderTarget = ((elderFloor + elderCeil) / 2) | round -%}
{%- set promoSubject = 'POAP KINGS #' + site.clanTag + ' · War-focused clan with real culture · ' + minTrophies + ' trophies · ' + memberCount + '/50 members' -%}
{%- set promoBody = 'POAP KINGS (#' + site.clanTag + ') is recruiting — a war-focused Clash Royale clan with real structure. ' + memberCount + ' members, ' + latest.count12000Plus + ' players at 12k+ trophies, ' + latest.count14000Plus + ' sitting at 14,000, and ' + winsK + 'K+ career wins across the roster. Public roster and clan data, a Free Pass Royale program for top war earners, and a culture that actually remembers who shows up. ' + minTrophies + ' trophy minimum. See us at ' + site.url -%}

<div class="pk-members-backdrop">
<div class="pk-page pk-page--mid pk-page-shell">
  <div class="pk-members-badge">Members Zone</div>
  <h1 class="pk-members-title">Welcome, KING.</h1>
  <p class="pk-members-intro">Your hub for getting connected. Two things matter most: get into Discord, and connect with leadership so you're eligible for a free Pass Royale.</p>

  <div class="pk-grid-2 pk-members-cards">
    {{ infoCard('Primary', 'Join our Discord', 'Announcements, deck talk, war coordination, and Sunday Scrimmages all happen here. Set your nickname to your Clash Royale name so we know who you are.', site.discordUrl, 'Open Discord', 'purple', true) }}
    {{ infoCard('Required for rewards', 'Connect with Leadership', 'Friend King Thing (Thingles) on the Supercell Store. This is required for us to send you a free Pass Royale if you win it — do it now so there are no delays later. Need the full walkthrough? See the <a href="/members/setup/">Clan Setup guide</a>.', 'https://link.clashroyale.com/?supercell_id&p=16-2db22667-604d-4726-a68d-8f1337d26a5c', 'Connect with Thingles →', 'gold', true) }}
  </div>

  <!-- Elixir email capture (no Discord needed) -->
  <article class="pk-elixir-hero pk-email-card">
    <img class="pk-email-card__mascot" src="/assets/elixir.png" alt="Elixir mascot">
    <div>
      <span class="pk-email-card__kicker">Not on Discord? No problem.</span>
      <h2 class="pk-email-card__title">Get clan updates from Elixir</h2>
      <p class="pk-email-card__copy">Create a prefilled email to Jamie with your player name and address. Your email app will let you review it before anything is sent.</p>
      <form class="pk-email-form" action="mailto:Jamie@thingelstad.com" method="get" data-email-form data-email-to="Jamie@thingelstad.com">
        <label class="pk-form-field pk-form-field--full" for="elixirPlayer">Player name
        <select class="pk-form-control" id="elixirPlayer" name="player" required>
          <option value="" disabled selected>Select your player name…</option>
          {%- for m in roster.members | sort(false, false, 'name') %}
          <option value="{{ m.name }}">{{ m.name }}</option>
          {%- endfor %}
        </select>
        </label>
        <label class="pk-form-field" for="elixirEmail">Email
          <input class="pk-form-control" id="elixirEmail" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com">
        </label>
        <button class="pk-action pk-action--gold" type="submit" data-tinylytics-event="members.email-draft">Create email</button>
      </form>
      <p class="pk-email-done" data-email-done hidden>Draft ready. <a class="pk-email-done__link" data-email-mailto href="mailto:Jamie@thingelstad.com">Open it in your email app →</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- how elder works -->
  <section class="pk-section">
    {{ sectionHeading('How Elder works', 'Participation, not prestige') }}
    <p class="pk-promo-intro">Elder is earned by playing, and every input is something you
      control. Nothing here rewards trophies, card levels, or the Ranked league you
      reach. Elders should be <strong>20–30% of the clan</strong> — at {{ memberCount }} members
      that is <strong>{{ elderFloor }}–{{ elderCeil }}</strong>, and we aim at
      <strong>{{ elderTarget }}</strong>, the middle of the range rather than the bottom.</p>
    <div class="pk-grid-2 pk-setup-grid">
      {%- set elderSteps = [
        { n: '1', title: 'Who is considered',
          body: 'You need 28+ days in the clan, and you need to still be competing: at least one war day with a deck played in the last 14 days, or 5 or more ranked battles in the last 14.' },
        { n: '2', title: 'What is scored',
          body: 'Three things, each ranked against the rest of the clan — war rate (decks used out of decks available over 28 days), ranked battles played, and donations averaged over four weeks. Competing is 65% of your score and donations are 35%. Within the competing half war leads, and ranked fills part of what war leaves, so doing both beats doing either. Finishing a war day counts extra: all four decks is worth about 2.7x two decks, not 2x. Doing none of something scores zero for it.' },
        { n: '3', title: 'How many Elders',
          body: 'Two players too close to separate can both get in, up to ' + elderCeil + '. If nobody has earned it the count simply sits lower — nobody is promoted to hit a number. Sitting above the target is safe: the badge is lost by stopping playing, or by being clearly out-ranked. A near-tie keeps the current Elder — unless the member challenging them has been in the clan longer. Time served never earns Elder on its own, but it settles a close call.' },
        { n: '4', title: 'Sustained, not a snapshot',
          body: 'Qualifying once does nothing. It takes three qualifying weeks in a row before a promotion even reaches leadership, who make the final call. Going the other way, walking away from war and ranked entirely costs the badge in two weeks; losing it to a higher-ranked member takes three.' }
      ] -%}
      {%- for e in elderSteps %}
      {{ numberedCard(e.n, e.title, e.body) }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="pk-promo-intro">Short version: play war, play ranked, donate steadily, and keep
      it up for a month. That is the whole thing.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- promo tools -->
  <section class="pk-section">
    {{ sectionHeading('Promote the clan', 'Plug-and-play pitches') }}
    <p class="pk-promo-intro">Copy-ready recruiting copy. Use the <strong>subject</strong> when a title is needed (e.g. Reddit); the <strong>body</strong> stands on its own anywhere else (e.g. Discord).</p>
    <div class="pk-promo-panel">
      {{ promoField('Subject', 'promoSubject', promoSubject) }}
      {{ promoField('Body', 'promoBody', promoBody, true) }}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</div>
